{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "RED: A Modern Tale",
    "author": "ASAPS Builder",
    "description": "A modern retelling of Little Red Riding Hood about a teenage girl finding her authentic self",
    "genre": "Coming of Age",
    "created": "2025-11-25T01:31:34.921Z"
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "beat_title",
      "name": "Title Screen",
      "type": "titleScreen",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_intro",
          "label": "Start"
        }
      ],
      "x": 100,
      "y": 200,
      "parameters": {
        "title": "RED: A Modern Tale",
        "author": "Interactive Narrative",
        "buttonText": "Begin Journey"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_intro",
      "name": "Introduction",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_choice_path",
          "label": "Continue"
        }
      ],
      "x": 300,
      "y": 200,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You're Riley, a 16-year-old trying to figure out where you fit in.\n\nToday, your grandmother texted asking you to visit. She lives across town in the old neighborhood where you used to play as a kid. Your mom packed some homemade cookies for her.\n\nBut there's a problem: your new \"friends\" just invited you to hang out at the mall. They're the popular crowd you've been trying to impress all semester.",
        "buttonText": "What do I do?",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_choice_path",
      "name": "Choose Your Path",
      "type": "movementChoice",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 500,
      "y": 200,
      "parameters": {
        "question": "What matters more right now?",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "choice_grandma",
            "text": "Visit Grandma (family comes first)",
            "location": "grandma_path",
            "target": "beat_walk_start"
          },
          {
            "id": "choice_friends",
            "text": "Go to the mall (fitting in matters)",
            "location": "mall_path",
            "target": "beat_mall_scene"
          },
          {
            "id": "choice_compromise",
            "text": "Try to do both (visit quickly, then mall)",
            "location": "both_path",
            "target": "beat_rush_visit"
          }
        ],
        "choiceDelay": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_walk_start",
      "name": "Walking to Grandma",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_phone_pressure",
          "label": "Continue"
        }
      ],
      "x": 700,
      "y": 100,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You text your \"friends\" that you can't make it and head to Grandma's.\n\nAs you walk through the old neighborhood, memories flood back. The corner store where you'd buy candy. The park where you learned to ride a bike. Everything seems smaller now, but somehow more real than the filtered world of social media.\n\nYour phone buzzes constantly with messages from the group chat.",
        "buttonText": "Check phone",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_phone_pressure",
      "name": "Social Media Pressure",
      "type": "dialogTree",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 900,
      "y": 100,
      "parameters": {
        "dialogTree": {
          "id": "root",
          "text": "Madison: \"OMG where r u?? We're at the food court. Jake is here 👀\"",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "ignore",
              "text": "Silence phone and keep walking",
              "target": "response_ignore"
            },
            {
              "id": "reply_brief",
              "text": "Reply: \"Family thing. Have fun!\"",
              "target": "response_brief"
            },
            {
              "id": "feel_bad",
              "text": "Reply: \"Sorry! I really wanted to come 😞\"",
              "target": "response_apologetic"
            }
          ]
        },
        "speaker": "Group Chat",
        "text": "Madison: \"OMG where r u?? We're at the food court. Jake is here 👀\"",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "choiceDelay": 1.5
      },
      "dialogTree": {
        "id": "root",
        "text": "Madison: \"OMG where r u?? We're at the food court. Jake is here 👀\"",
        "emotion": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ignore",
            "text": "Silence phone and keep walking",
            "target": "response_ignore"
          },
          {
