      "speaker": "Madison",
      "text": "So, did you see what Sarah posted? She's trying SO hard. It's embarrassing.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "choiceDelay": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "mall_join_mockery",
      "name": "Hollow Victory",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_end_shallow",
          "label": "Finish"
        }
      ],
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 250,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You laugh along. Madison gives you an approving nod.\n\nFor the next hour, you sit with them, laughing at their jokes, agreeing with everything they say. They let you be in their stories. You're finally \"in.\"\n\nBut as you walk home alone, you feel... empty. Like you left something important behind.\n\nYour phone buzzes. It's your grandma: \"Hope you're having fun, sweetheart. Love you ❤️\"\n\nThe cookies are still in your bag, crushed.",
        "buttonText": "Go home",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "mall_defend",
      "name": "Stand Your Ground",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_leave_mall",
          "label": "Continue"
        }
      ],
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 350,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "The table goes quiet. Madison's smile freezes.\n\n\"Oh my god, are you serious right now?\" she says.\n\nJake looks uncomfortable. Emma and Tyler exchange glances. You just committed social suicide.\n\n\"Whatever. We're going to Sephora. You coming or not?\"\n\nYou realize: you don't want to go. You don't want to be here at all.",
        "buttonText": "Make a choice",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_rush_visit",
      "name": "Rushed Visit",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_grandma_hurt",
          "label": "Continue"
        }
      ],
      "x": 700,
      "y": 500,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You race to Grandma's house, planning to stay just 20 minutes.\n\nShe opens the door with a bright smile that fades when she sees you checking your phone.\n\n\"Riley, sweetheart, is everything okay? You seem distracted.\"\n\nYou hand her the cookies while texting Madison that you'll be there soon.",
        "buttonText": "Continue",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_grandma_hurt",
      "name": "Grandma's Disappointment",
      "type": "dialogTree",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 900,
      "y": 500,
      "parameters": {
        "dialogTree": {
          "id": "root",
          "text": "You don't have to stay if you don't want to, dear. I know you have your own life now.",
          "emotion": "sad",
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "stay",
              "text": "Put phone away and stay",
              "target": "choose_grandma_late"
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "Kiss her goodbye and leave",
              "target": "choose_friends_late"
            }
          ]
        },
