      ],
      "x": 1700,
      "y": 150,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You spend the afternoon with Grandma, listening to her stories, learning her secret cookie recipe, just... being yourself.\n\nNo performance. No anxiety about what to post or how to look. Just you and someone who loves you unconditionally.\n\nWhen you leave, she hugs you tight. \"You're going to be just fine, Riley. Trust yourself.\"\n\nWalking home, you finally understand what she means.",
        "buttonText": "Continue",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
