      "name": "True Self Ending",
      "type": "endScreen",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 100,
      "parameters": {
        "message": "ENDING: Finding Your Path\n\nYou chose authenticity over approval. Monday at school might be awkward, but you know who you are now.\n\nSometimes the scariest path - being yourself - is the one that leads somewhere real.\n\nYour grandma was right. The people worth knowing will find you.",
        "showRestart": true,
        "showCredits": false,
        "reset": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_end_shallow",
      "name": "Shallow Victory Ending",
      "type": "endScreen",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 300,
      "parameters": {
        "message": "ENDING: The Hollow Crown\n\nYou got what you wanted - acceptance from the popular crowd. But at what cost?\n\nYou missed meaningful connection with your grandma. You laughed at someone else's expense. You shaped yourself into what others wanted.\n\nThe crown you wear feels heavier than it looks.\n\nMaybe there's another way...",
        "showRestart": true,
        "showCredits": false,
        "reset": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_end_divided",
      "name": "Divided Ending",
      "type": "endScreen",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [],
      "x": 1900,
      "y": 500,
      "parameters": {
        "message": "ENDING: Split in Two\n\nYou tried to please everyone and ended up pleasing no one - including yourself.\n\nYour grandma felt rushed. Your friends felt like an afterthought. You felt exhausted.\n\nSometimes you can't have it all. Sometimes you have to choose what matters.\n\nWhat will you choose next time?",
        "showRestart": true,
        "showCredits": false,
        "reset": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "beat_leave_mall",
