      "x": 1300,
      "y": 350,
      "parameters": {
        "text": "\"I think I'm going to head out actually.\"\n\nMadison's face hardens. \"Seriously? Whatever. Don't bother texting us later.\"\n\nYou walk out of the mall alone. Your heart is pounding. Did you just throw away your entire social life?\n\nBut then you remember the cookies in your bag. Grandma.\n\nYou pull out your phone and text her: \"On my way. Can I still visit?\"\n\nHer reply is instant: \"My door is always open, sweetheart ❤️\"",
        "buttonText": "Go to Grandma's",
        "locs": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "choose_grandma_late",
      "name": "Better Late Than Never",
      "type": "introText",
      "locations": [],
      "connections": [
        {
          "targetId": "beat_reflection",
          "label": "Continue"
